flowchart TD
    U[User request] --> C[1 Context: load relevant sources]
    C --> G[2 Goals: clarify and negotiate]
    G --> P[3 Plan: discover and match capabilities]
    P --> D{Authorized and feasible?}
    D -->|Yes| E[4 Execute dependency-ready work]
    D -->|Decision needed| W[Wait on affected work only]
    W -->|Decision received| P
    E --> V{5 Verify necessary criteria}
    V -->|Pass| O[7 Deliver artifacts and evidence]
    V -->|Gap with feasible repair| R[6 Diagnose and refine]
    R -->|Artifact repair| E
    R -->|Method of verification| V
    R -->|Source issue| C
    R -->|Goal change| G
    R -->|Capability change| P
    R -->|Limit or no feasible path| H[Accurate partial or blocked handoff]
    D -->|No qualified fallback| H
    E -->|Cancelled or cannot continue| H
    H --> O
